Package: ubig-control
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: SP11 Audio Project
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0
Description: UbiG profile and 20-band speaker equalizer control
 A small GTK4 userspace controller for the UbiG native SP11 speaker engine.
 It changes profiles and Custom GEQ state in place through the versioned UbiG
 realtime control page and does not restart PipeWire or modify the kernel.
